<title>USA: Fletcher Challenge unit sets 2-part deal.</title>
<headline>Fletcher Challenge unit sets 2-part deal.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following two-tranche issue from Fletcher Challenge Capital Canada Inc was priced on Wednesday, according to lead manager Merrill Lynch &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>Fletcher Challenge Capital Canada Inc is a unit of Fletcher Challenge Canada Inc, whose ulitimate parent is Fletcher Challenge of New Zealand.</p>
<p>BORROWER FLETCHER CHALLENGE CAPITAL CANADA INC AMT $200 MLN	 COUPON 7.50 PCT   MATURITY 3/24/2007</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.889  FIRST PAY DATE 9/24/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA2  YIELD 7.516 PCT   PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB	 SPREAD 77 BP	CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	 COUPON 7.875 PCT  MATURITY 3/24/2017</p>
<p>TYPE BONDS	   ISS PRICE 99.631  FIRST PAY DATE 9/24/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA2  YIELD 7.912 PCT   PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB	 SPREAD 87 BP	CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>((--U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212 859-1678))</p>
